eft": 12, "startDate": "2027-03-10"}, {"id": 15, "price": 1899, "status": "Guaranteed", "endDate": "2027-04-16", "spotsLeft": 5, "startDate": "2027-04-02"}]	[]	[{"id": 11, "date": "2022-07-24", "title": "Peter Van", "author": "Deluxe Annapurna Circuit Trek", "rating": 5, "comment": "Dear Expert Representative, Thank you for your follow-up. I have absolutely no complaints about your professional travel service - everything was excellent from start to finish. First of all, your quick responses to our emails, even while we were on the trip in Nepal, were truly appreciated. We had the best trekking holiday with our guide Mingmar and porter Sonam during the Annapurna Circuit trek. They were both outstanding - professional, friendly, and incredibly supportive throughout. The deluxe lodges included in your trekking package were fantastic. Each one had hot showers and served delicious food - a real treat after a day on the trail. Your hotel in Kathmandu was also lovely, especially the peaceful garden setting. We're especially grateful for the thoughtful touches you included, like the complimentary full-body massage after the trek and the cultural dinner experience. These really added to our unforgettable memories of Nepal. Thanks again for your excellent trekking services. We hope to return for another trek in the future and will definitely be in touch. Wishing you all the best with your upcoming trekking clients! Warm regards, Peter", "country": "Canada"}, {"id": 29, "date": "2024-11-18", "title": "Jeff R", "author": "Best Trekking Experience in Nepal – Deluxe Annapurna Circuit Trek", "rating": 5, "comment": "Thanks, Expert Representative, for providing us with the best trekking experience in Nepal that we've ever had. We will definitely come back! We had an amazing trek with your professional Expert Representative Team. Our guide, Tashi, and porter, Nima, were excellent, and all the lodges along the trek were truly deluxe. Everything was perfect. We highly recommend this deluxe Annapurna Circuit trek to everyone, and we'll be booking another trek with you soon.", "country": "Canada"}, {"id": 66, "date": "2025-04-25", "title": "Michael R", "author": "Thank You for an Amazing Annapurna Trek", "rating": 5, "comment": "Namaste Expert Representative, Yes, we had a truly great trekking trip on the Annapurna Circuit! Your guide and porter were excellent - they made our holiday absolutely wonderful. Their experience and care really stood out, and we felt well looked after every step of the way. Everything went smoothly throughout the trek. Thank you for your quick responses, the well-chosen lodges with high-quality food, and the private transport and comfortable hotels in the cities. It was all handled very professionally, and we really appreciated the attention to detail. We hope to see you again for another adventure in Nepal! Warm regards, Michael R", "country": "California"}, {"id": 67, "date": "2025-04-25", "title": "Jeff C", "author": "Fantastic Annapurna circuit Trek", "rating": 5, "comment": "Hello Expert Representative and Team, We had a great trek - everything went smoothly, and we truly enjoyed your deluxe Annapurna Circuit itinerary. Thank you for all the arrangements and support throughout the journey. Best wishes to you and your team, and we look forward to seeing you again for another trek in the future! Warm regards, Jeff C", "country": "Australia"}, {"id": 68, "date": "2025-04-25", "title": "Linda S", "author": "Amazing Annapurna Circuit Trek – Thank You!", "rating": 5, "comment": "Hello Expert Representative, Your 17-day Annapurna Circuit itinerary worked perfectly for us! We successfully crossed the Thorong La Pass (5,416m), and the whole experience was unforgettable. Starting the trek with two days of private car drives, and another drive after the pass, was a great decision - avoiding those long road-walk sections made the trip much more enjoyable. The deluxe lodges with attached bathrooms and hot showers added a lot of comfort and real value to the package. We also really appreciated all the small but important services you arranged - hot water, battery charging, warm showers, and even trekking gear support. Your guide gave us excellent advice: enjoy meals of our choice from the menu and drink lots of hot fluids to stay hydrated during the trek. And our porter was so kind, humble, and helpful throughout. Honestly, your trekking service is marvelous - we fully enjoyed it and would highly recommend it to anyone planning a trek in Nepal. Hope to see you again on our next adventure! Warm regards, Linda S", "country": "Ireland"}]	5.0	31	2026-10-23 20:31:04.764319+06
13	Deluxe Manaslu Circuit Trek	deluxe-manaslu-circuit-trek	15 Days Guided Himalayan Adventure	deluxe-trekking	Manaslu	deluxe-nepal-trekking-tours	15	1699	2000	1799	2100	Moderate	4,500m	Spring (Mar-May) & Autumn (Sep-Nov)	4-Star City Hotel & Deluxe Attached-Bath Lodges	Full Board (Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner) on Trek	2 – 12 Guests (Private or Small Group)	t	bestseller	/images/upload/package/larkey-pass-manaslu-circuit-trek.jpeg	["/images/upload/package/larkey-pass-manaslu-circuit-trek.jpeg", "/images/unsplash/photo-1518002054494-3a6f94352e9d-1200.jpg", "/images/unsplash/photo-1464822759023-fed622ff2c3b-1200.jpg"]	<p><span style="font-size:20px"><strong>Deluxe Manaslu Circuit Trek - 15&nbsp;Days</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="color:#B22222"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>What is the Deluxe Manaslu Circuit Trek and What Makes It Deluxe?</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:16px">Mount Manaslu, the eighth highest mountain in the world, offers one of the most breathtaking trekking experiences. The trek includes crossing Larke La Pass (5,106m) to connect with the Annapurna Circuit, making it a remarkable journey through the Manaslu Conservation Area. This region is remote and moderately challenging, regulated under a restricted trekking trail that requires a special trekking permit.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:16px">The Deluxe Manaslu Circuit Trek organized by NETTA begins with an overland jeep drive to Sotikhola-Arughat in the Gorkha district, which takes approximately 9&ndash;10 hours. We will need to present our special trekking permits to enter the area. While the lodgings along this route are typically simple guest houses or homestays, we carefully select the best available accommodations to ensure a deluxe experience with top-notch services.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:16px">During this trek, we traverse the high Larke La Pass and join the famous Annapurna Circuit before concluding our journey in Besisahar. As there are no road connections along this route, we will take a local jeep from Dharapani to Besisahar and Kathmandu. One of the most appealing aspects of this trek is that you will start and finish in different locations, allowing for a unique experience without repeating any days on the same trail. This feature adds significant value for trekkers.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:16px">Moreover, the Manaslu trekking trail sees fewer trekkers compared to popular routes like Annapurna or Everest, thanks to its remoteness, the special permit system, and restrictions on individual backpacker trekkers. This makes the Manaslu Circuit a true hidden gem for those seeking an unforgettable adventure.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="color:#B22222"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>Why Should You Book a Deluxe Manaslu Circuit Trek with Us?</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:16px">Here are four compelling reasons to join our Manaslu trek:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Best Value for Money</strong>: Our trekking package offers exceptional value, featuring the highest level of service to ensure a memorable experience.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Optimized Itinerary</strong>: We provide the best itinerary for a safe and comfortable trek, carefully designed to enhance your trekking experience.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Quality Accommodations</strong>: Enjoy the best value in accommodations throughout the trek, with carefully selected lodges and homestays that meet our deluxe standards.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Expert Guidance</strong>: Benefit from over 15 years of experience from our expert guides and porters, ensuring you have the best trekking experience in Nepal.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="color:#B22222"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>Is This Trekking for Me? How Difficult Is the Deluxe Manaslu Circuit Trek?</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:16px">The Deluxe Manaslu Circuit Trek is classified as moderate to difficult. Trekkers with some experience in walking, alpine routes, or hiking should find it manageable. The highest point on this trek is Larke La Pass (5,106m), and daily walking hours range from 6 to 7 hours, depending on the altitude. If you are fit and prepared to walk for 6-7 hours a day at a moderate pace, we warmly welcome you to this grand adventure!</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="color:#B22222"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>Best Seasons for the Deluxe Manaslu Trek</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:16px">Like other trekking areas, the Manaslu trail offers stunning views during prime trekking months. The best times to embark on this trek are:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Fall Season</strong>: Mid-September to mid-December</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Spring Season</strong>: March to May</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:16px">For photography enthusiasts, the optimal months are mid-October to early December and April to May, when the scenery is particularly breathtaking.</span></p>	Deluxe Manaslu Circuit Trek - 15 Days What is the Deluxe Manaslu Circuit Trek and What Makes It Deluxe? Mount Manaslu, the eighth highest mountain in the world, offers one of the most breathtaking trekking experiences. The trek includes crossing Larke La Pass (5,106m) to connect with the Annapurna Circuit, making it a remarkable journey through the Manaslu Conservation Area. This region is remote and moderately challenging, regulated under a restricted trekking trail that requires a special trekking permit. The Deluxe Manaslu Circuit Trek organized by NETTA begins with an overland jeep drive to Sotikhola-Arughat in the Gorkha district, which takes approximately 9-10 hours. We will need to present our special trekking permits to enter the area. While the lodgings along this route are typically simple guest houses or homestays, we carefully select the best available accommodations to ensure a deluxe experience with top-notch services. During this trek, we traverse the high Larke La Pass and join the famous Annapurna Circuit before concluding our journey in Besisahar. As there are no road connections along this route, we will take a local jeep from Dharapani to Besisahar and Kathmandu		<p><span style="color:rgb(139, 69, 19)"><span style="font-size:18px"><span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"><strong>Comfortable, deluxe accommodations and hygienic meals</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">Deluxe 4&nbsp;or 5-star (depending on the package) Hotel accommodation in Kathmandu on twin share with breakfast (2<span style="color:rgb(139, 69, 19)"><strong>&nbsp;nights).</strong></span></span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(139, 69, 19)"><strong>12&nbsp;nights at the best selected lodge or guest house</strong></span>&nbsp;with a common bathroom including hot and cold showers.</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">There are 3 hygienic vegetarian or non-vegetarian meals per day: breakfast, lunch, and dinner (you can choose meals from all over the Lodge every day).</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">Tea/coffee or other hot beverages during breakfast, lunch, and dinner (5&ndash;6 cups per day).</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">seasonal fruits and additional biscuit/cookies snacks&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="color:rgb(139, 69, 19)"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>Private transportation that is comfortable</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">private, comfortable vehicle tour 