d": 27, "date": "2024-11-17", "title": "Jim Freeland", "author": "A lifetime dream of a mountain pilgrimage realized.", "rating": 5, "comment": "CCC Nepal Trekking Tours is excellent. Expert Representative and Tendi took very good care of us, with great attention to detail. Everything, from pre-trip planning and responding to our questions, to the trip itself, was organized seamlessly. Our guide, Pema Dorjee Sherpa , and our porter, Nima , were rock stars! I can't say enough good things about both of them. Pema Dorjee Sherpa was friendly, accommodating, knowledgeable, and responsive. He not only guided us on the trek, but also shared the beauty of the area in a way that made the experience much more meaningful. His insights into the history, culture, and local traditions, paired with his humor, created a deeper connection to the place. If I visit Nepal again, I will definitely hire CCC Nepal Trekking Tours again. I've dreamed of seeing the Himalayas with my own eyes for most of my life, and CCC Nepal Trekking Tours made that dream come true. If anyone is considering a trek in Nepal, I highly recommend going with CCC Nepal Trekking Tours . They are more than five stars!!", "country": "California, USA"}, {"id": 1, "date": "2021-10-07", "title": "Adam Smith", "author": "Best trekking tour service- Excellent Local Travel Agency in Nepal", "rating": 5, "comment": "My wife and I did Everest base camp trek with Expert Representative's company in march 2015. The service from Airport pick up to final drop off was excellent. city tour guide is excellent in information about heritage sites. our trekking guide Expert Representative is outstanding. our porter Ngima tendi is so kind made our trek so special. all the lodges selected were very nice with choices of meals. overall we had a great time and we would like to reccommend Expert Representative's company to all. we are coming back again for another trip with CCC Nepal trekking tours company. Adam", "country": "USA"}]	5.0	12	