20 ft.) and trek to Ghopte (3430m /11,578 ft.)>> 14 km>> 6/7 hrs>>Lodge( B+/L+D)", "walking": "7-8 hours trekking", "altitude": "3430 m", "distance": "14 km", "description": "Full guided day in the Himalayas with luxury lodge hospitality and scenic trails.", "accommodation": "Lodge( B+/L+D)", "transportation": "On Foot / Trekking"}, {"day": 14, "meal": "Breakfast + lunch + Dinner(B/L/D)", "title": "Day 13: Trek from Gopte to Tharepati(3690 m /12,103 ft.)>>3/4 hrs>> Lodge( B+/L+D)", "walking": "3-4 hours trekking", "altitude": "3690 m", "distance": "6 km", "description": "Full guided day in the Himalayas with luxury lodge hospitality and scenic trails.", "accommodation": "Lodge( B+/L+D)", "transportation": "On Foot / Trekking"}, {"day": 15, "meal": "Breakfast + lunch + Dinner(B/L/D)", "title": "Day 14: Trek from Tharepati to Khutumsang( 2471m /8105 ft)>> 6 hrs >>Lodge( B/L/D)", "walking": "5-6 hours trekking", "altitude": "2471 m", "distance": "10-12 km", "description": "Full guided day in the Himalayas with luxury lodge hospitality and scenic trails.", "accommodation": "Lodge( B+/L+D)", "transportation": "On Foot / Trekking"}, {"day": 16, "meal": "Breakfast + lunch + Dinner(B+L+D)", "title": "Day 15: Second last of Langtang Gosaikunda Deluxe trek: Trek to Chisapani( 2194 m), best hill for mountain views>> 6 hrs->>Lodge( B/L/D)", "walking": "6-7 hours trek", "altitude": "2194 m", "distance": "12 km", "description": "Full guided day in the Himalayas with luxury lodge hospitality and scenic trails.", "accommodation": "Lodge( B+L+D)", "transportation": "On Foot / Trekking"}, {"day": 17, "meal": "Breakfast + Lunch", "title": "Day 16: LAST DAY OF Trek from Chispani to Sundarijal (1463m),4-5 hours and drive back to Kathmandu, transfer to hotel- Deluxe hotel( B+B)", "walking": "4-5 hours Trekking", "altitude": "1400", "distance": "10 km trek + 20 km drive", "description": "Full guided day in the Himalayas with luxury lodge hospitality and scenic trails.", "accommodation": "