ndu-Nagarkot- Kathmandu by deluxe private car</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="color:#800000"><span style="font-size:20px"><strong>baggage allowance and domestic flights + Mountain Flight</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:18px">Kathmandu- Mountain/Everest view &nbsp;flight- 1 hour( 229 USD) including two way Airport transfers</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:18px">Lumbini- Kathmandu flight including Airport transfers</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:18px">The baggage allowance on domectic flight is total of 20 kg per person.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="color:#800000"><span style="font-size:20px"><strong>Professional private tour guides</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:18px">professional English-speaking tour guide for sightseeing in the city as specified in the itinerary.</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:18px">Daily wage, lodging, meals, and guide&nbsp;insurance.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="color:#800000"><span style="font-size:20px"><strong>Monuments, temples, and heritage sites Entrance fees</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:18px">Entrance fees to all UNESCO heritage sites during city sightseeing in Kathmandu,Pokhara, Chitwan, Lumbini, Bandipur, Nagarkot</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:18px">&nbsp;Cable Car ticket for Chandragiri Hill</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="color:#800000"><span style="font-size:20px"><strong>Free information or guest services.</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:18px">guide to purchasing clothing or Souveniers</span>&nbsp;<span style="font-size:18px">as well as any other required wholesale shopping in Kathmandu.</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:18px">Support in the case of baggage loss or delay in Kathmandu from international flights to Nepal</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:18px">Support to exchange money, get a local SIM card</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:18px">24/7 emergency call support.</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:18px">Free safe baggage storage service during the tour</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="color:#800000"><span style="font-size:20px"><strong>Free welcome dinner &amp; farewell professional body massage after the tour</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:18px">We offer a free welcome Nepalese dinner with authentic Nepalese cultural dances on arrival day, or if you arrive late on arrival night, this will be provided on the second day.</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:18px">After the tour, you will receive a FREE 1-hour Ayurvedic full-body massage as a treatment for your tired body.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="color:#A52A2A"><span style="font-size:20px"><strong>Other free services include:</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:18px">tour certificate as a gift.</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:18px">The company&#39;s gift</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n	<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-left: 0px; color: rgb(82, 82, 82); font-family: domine, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: rgb(254, 254, 254);">\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">Nepal Visa-US $ 30 for 15 days</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">International Flight to/from Kathmandu/home</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">Travel and Emergency Helicopter Evacuation Insurance</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">Meals (lunch and dinner) and other expenses which are not included in the tour package ( all breakfasts are included)</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">Any soft drinks or alcoholic drinks, bottled water,</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">Tips for guides and drivers</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n		[{"label": "1 Traveler (Solo Private)", "maxPax": 1, "minPax": 1, "deluxePrice": 1949, "luxuryPrice": 2349}, {"label": "2 – 3 Travelers", "maxPax": 3, "minPax": 2, "deluxePrice": 1699, "luxuryPrice": 1999}, {"label": "4 – 6 Travelers", "maxPax": 6, "minPax": 4, "deluxePrice": 1580, "luxuryPrice": 1859}, {"label": "7 – 12 Travelers (Group)", "maxPax": 12, "minPax": 7, "deluxePrice": 1478, "luxuryPrice": 1739}]	[{"day": 1, "meal": "FREE welcome Dinner", "title": "Day 01: Best of Nepal Deluxe Tour warm welcomes you in Kathmandu & Transfer to Hotel- Deluxe Hotel(D)", "walking": "-", "altitude": "1400m", "distance": "10-12 km", "description": "We welcome you in Kathmandu, ancient city of Nepal, the capital city of Nepal. it takes about 20-25 minute drive to your hotel in city. today is free day to relax at hotel or explore around yourself if your flights land in Kathmandu early. we will make tour meeting at your hotel after arrival. evening 6 pm, we pick up you for Cultural dinner in one of best cultural restaurent in Kathmandu city.", "accommodation": "Hotel( Dinner)", "transportation": "Private Car transfer to Hotel"}, {"day": 2, "meal": " Lavish Breakfast", "title": "Day 02: 5 am Drive to Airport for 1 hour Mountain Flight to see Mt Everest & More, after breakfast at hotel Full Day Sightseeing in Kathmandu( 4 popular heritage sites/monuments)-7/8 hours, overnight at Deluxe Hotel( B/B)", "walking": "5-6 hours", "altitude": "3,440m / 11,286ft", "distance": "10-12 km", "description": "Today, you have to wake up very early morning around 5 am to take most valuable mountain flight schedule normally 6.15 am. this flights guide you to show more than dozens of highest peaks of himalayas including highest peak of the world- Mount Everest in closest window view of mountain flight. after this flight, you will return drive to hotel to enjoy Lavish breakfast and start day tour of Kathmandu. we have included 4 Heritage sites in the tour today- Kathmandu durbar Square( 14-16 century old royal palace, museam, temples), Swoyambunath stupa, Boudhanath Stupa and Pasupatinath temple. It all 4 places takes about 7-8 hours in total to visit and explore the areas in details. your tour guide will explain well about this ancient heriatges.", "accommodation": "Deluxe Hotel( B+B)", "transportation": "Mountain flight( 1 hour) +Private Car tour in Kathmandu"}, {"day": 3, "meal": " Lavish Breakfast", "title": "Day 03: Drive to Chandragiri hills( 14 km), take Cable Car ride to see temples, hills, valley, mountains from Top of Hill & Drive to Bandipur( 135 km), overnight at Deluxe Hotel( B/B)", "walking": "Private car drive to Bhandipur", "altitude": "1030 m", "distance": "149 km drive by Car", "description": "After breakfast we drive to Cable car station of Chandragiri Hills about 35 minute, take a cable car of about 10 minute to reach the top hill to see mountain views in clear days, valley views, hillside views, temples etc. then we cable ride back to station down and Car drive to Bhandipur, one of preserved local village, town. it is about 135 km drive to reach Bhandipur, we also can see mountain views, hills and scenic drive to Bhandipur.", "accommodation": "Deluxe Hotel( B+B)", "transportation": "Private car drive + Cable car Ride"}, {"day": 4, "meal": "Lavish Breakfast", "title": "Day 04: After Breakfast at Bhandipur, we Drive to Pokhara(76 km), the most beautiful city of Nepal for Lakes, mountains and Temples, Transfer to Hotel, sunset tour of peace stupa in Pokhara overnight at Deluxe Hotel( B/B)", "walking": "Peace stupa sun set tour( 2-3 hours)", "altitude": "822 m", "distance": "76 km drive", "description": "After breakfast, we drive to Pokhara, the paradise city of Nepal because of its natural beauty. you have chances to explore sunrise, sunset, temples, caves, lakes, mountains and many more.. Today we reach pokhara, check into hotel and then walk around lake side for a while, we drive to peace stupa to see sunset views of Pokhara Valley, mountains and lakes. Peace stupa offers best views of whole Pokhara and mountains. we drive back to Lakeside and evening walk around lakeside and enjoy the dinners.", "accommodation": "Deluxe Hotel( B+ B)", "transportation": "Private car drive to Pokhara"}, {"day": 5, "meal": "Lavish Breakfast", "title": "Day 05:  AM sunrise tour of Sarangkot hill, back to hotel and City Sightseeing( Gupteshower Cave, devi's fall, Mountain museum, bhindyabasini temple, Seti river view & Boating at Fewa lake to explore Barahi temple in Pokhara( 3-4 hours), overnight at Delu", "walking": "5-6 hours", "altitude": "822 m", "distance": "35 km approximate", "description": "Early morning depend on sunrise time, you have to drive about 12 km to Sarangkot hill to see sunrise views over the mountains of Annapurna, Daulagiri, nilgiri, fishtail mountain and many more mountains. this sunrise is spectacular if weather is clear. after sunrise we back to hotel... have breakfast at hotel and the start tour of pokhara city. the tour places are Devis fall, gupteshower cave, mountain museam, Seti River george, Bhindyabasini temple and finally boating at fewa lake to see Barahi temple located middle of lake. its about 3-4 hours of tours today. after lunch optionally you can buy paragliding flight of about 20-30 minute as additional adventure in pokhara.", "accommodation": "Deluxe Hotel( B+ B)", "transportation": "Private car tour in Pokhara"}, {"day": 6, "meal": "Breakfast + Lunch + Dinner(B+L+D)", "title": "Day 06: after breakfast 7.30 am we Drive to Chitwan National park( 152 km), Lunch at Hotel in Chitwan included today. wildlife safari starts today as per hotel time schedule. overnight at Deluxe Hotel( B/L/D)", "walking": "Village tour in Chitwan", "altitude": "70 m", "distance": "152 km", "description": "We drive to Chitwan National park today, which is another best tourist destination in Nepal to explore real jungle safari adventures. takes about 5 hours to reach Chitwan from Pokhara. we have lunch at hotel in Chitwan National park. after lunch you will follow activities.", "accommodation": "Deluxe Hotel( B+ L+D)", "transportation": "Private car from Pokhara to Chitwan National Park"}, {"day": 7, "meal": "Breakfast + Lunch + Dinner(B+L+D)", "title": "Day 07: Full day jungle safari activities in Chitwan National Park today, Lunch and dinner at hotel, overnight at Deluxe Hotel( B+L+D)", "walking": "2-3 hours walking in Jungle", "altitude": "70 m", "distance": "10-12 km", "description": "The chitwan Jungle activities are: Village tour, Cultural show in the evening, jungle walk, jungle safari on Elephant, small Boating tour to see wild animals including crocodile and birds etc, elephant breeding centre tour, elephant bathing and Jeep drive( Optional of elephand ride). the hotel has schedule of all adventure activities in chitwan, all meals are included in chitwan package.", "accommodation": "Deluxe Hotel( B+ L+D)", "transportation": "On Foot / Trekking"}, {"day": 8, "meal": "Lavish Breakfast", "title": "Day 08:  After breakfast,Private car drive to Lumbini, birth place of lord buddha( 5 hours), tour of Birth place of Buddha, temples, monasteries, sacred garden( 3 hrs)- Deluxe Hotel( B+ B)", "walking": "3 hours cultural tour", "altitude": "150 m", "distance": "175 km", "description": "We leave chitwan today 7 am after breakfast, early is better. it takes about 4-5 hours drive to Lumbini today. after hotel check in and lunch, you will guide to see sacred garden, ashok Pillar, Mayadevi temple( Mother of Buddha), monasteries, temples, its altogether about 3-4 hours best cultural tour in Lumbini to see this unesco world heritage site of Nepal.", "accommodation": "Deluxe Hotel( B+B)", "transportation": "Private Car to Lumbini + Private car tour in Lumbini"}, {"day": 9, "meal": "Lavish Breakfast", "title": "Day 09:  After breakfast we Fly to 