Luxury ABC Helicopter trek- 5/6 hrs- Excellent view Lodge ( B/L/D)", "walking": "5-6 hours Trekking", "altitude": "2178", "distance": "9.8 km", "description": "Full guided day in the Himalayas with luxury lodge hospitality and scenic trails.", "accommodation": "Excellent view Lodge ( B/L/D)- BEST LODGE", "transportation": "On Foot / Trekking"}, {"day": 6, "meal": "Breakfast + Lunch + Dinner(B/L/D)", "title": "Day 06: Trekking to Bamboo (2310 m), 5th day of Trek Luxury Annapurna BC Helicopter trek- 4/5 hrs- Best available Lodge (B/L/D)", "walking": "4-5 hour Trekking", "altitude": "2310m", "distance": "8.6 km", "description": "Full guided day in the Himalayas with luxury lodge hospitality and scenic trails.", "accommodation": "Best available Lodge (B/L/D)", "transportation": "On Foot / Trekking"}, {"day": 7, "meal": "Breakfast + Lunch + Dinner(B/L/D)", "title": "Day 07: Trekking to Deurali (3230),6th day of Luxury Helicopter ABC trek- 4/5 hrs, Best available Lodge (B/L/D)", "walking": "4-5 hour Trekking", "altitude": "3230m", "distance": "9 km", "description": "Full guided day in the Himalayas with luxury lodge hospitality and scenic trails.", "accommodation": "Best available Lodge (B/L/D)", "transportation": "On Foot / Trekking"}, {"day": 8, "meal": "Breakfast + Lunch + Dinner(B/L/D)", "title": "Day 08: Trekking to Annapurna base camp (4130m), the Highest point of This Luxury trek-4 hrs- Best available Lodge (B/L/D)", "walking": "4-5 hours Trekking", "altitude": "4130m- Annapurna base camp( High point)", "distance": "8 km", "description": "Full guided day in the Himalayas with luxury lodge hospitality and scenic trails.", "accommodation": "Best available Lodge (B/L/D)", "transportation": "On Foot / Trekking"}, {"day": 9, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Day 09.Helicopter flight back to Pokhara, city tour in Pokhara( 3 hrs), fly to Kathmandu- Hotel Marriot( B/B)- TOP Luxury hotel", "walking": "5-6 hours", "altitude": "1400", "distance": "10-12 km", "description": "Full guided day in the Himalayas with luxury lodge hospitality and scenic trails.", "accommodation": "Hotel Marriot( B/B)- TOP Luxury hotel", "transportation": "Flights +Private car tour in Pokhara"}, {"day": 10, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Day 10:Last day of Luxury Helicopter Annapurna base camp trek- departure from Kathmandu to home, See you again", "walking": "-", "altitude": "3,440m / 11,286ft", "distance": "10-12 km", "description": "Full guided day in the Himalayas with luxury lodge hospitality and scenic trails.", "accommodation": "5-Star Luxury Mountain Lodge", "transportation": "Private car transfer to Airport"}]	[{"id": 191, "price": 3200, "status": "Guaranteed", "endDate": "2026-11-15", "spotsLeft": 6, "startDate": "2026-11-01"}, {"id": 192, "price": 3200, "status": "Available", "endDate": "2026-11-29", "spotsLeft": 8, "startDate": "2026-11-15"}, {"id": 193, "price": 3200, "status": "Available", "endDate": "2026-12-19", "spotsLeft": 10, "startDate": "2026-12-05"}, {"id": 194, "price": 3200, "status": "Available", "endDate": "2027-03-24", "spotsLeft": 12, "startDate": "2027-03-10"}, {"id": 195, "price": 3200, "status": "Guaranteed", "endDate": "2027-04-16", "spotsLeft": 5, "startDate": "2027-04-02"}]	[]	[{"id": 6, "date": "2022-07-24", "title": "mike", "author": "Luxury Helicopter Annapurna Base Camp Trek", "rating": 5, "comment": "My wife and I are looking for a little luxury trek in Nepal and during a search on the internet, we found CCC Nepal trekking tours company is offering luxury annapurna base camp trek with a helicopter in Pokhara. We booked this trek with Expert Representative. He is super fast at communication and provides full information anytime. His guide Lhakpa and porter Ganesh are very professional staff. They pick all the nicest lodges along the trail to make our accommodation as comfortable as possible. They recommend the best foods all the time. They walk with us all the time and are always helpful for small things like the best photos, rest locations and lunch places. Besides that, hotels in the cities are really luxurious and private cars and flights are included to make the trip the best experience. We are coming back again with them for another trek in Nepal. Best regards, Mike and Amanda", "country": "Brazil"}, {"id": 59, "date": "2025-04-20", "title": "Daniel", "author": "Excellent Luxury Annapurna Base Camp Trek with Helicopter Return", "rating": 5, "comment": "This trek was very well organized with excellent support from our guide and porter - both were extremely helpful throughout the journey. Expert Representative was quick to respond to every message and made sure everything was arranged perfectly. The hotels in Kathmandu and Pokhara were top-class, and the lodges along the trek were among the best available. While a few places didn't have attached bathrooms, most nights were comfortable and deluxe. The helicopter return after the ABC trek was a fantastic way to end the trip - scenic, fast, and comfortable. This is clearly an upgraded itinerary , and in my opinion, the price is fair for the quality of service and comfort provided. I really enjoyed this trek a lot and would happily recommend it to anyone looking for a high-end trekking experience in Nepal. Daniel", "country": "Australia"}, {"id": 60, "date": "2025-04-20", "title": "Rob", "author": "Wonderful Annapurna Base Camp Luxury Helicopter Trek", "rating": 5, "comment": "In October 2024 , I had the pleasure of doing the Annapurna Base Camp luxury helicopter trek with Expert Representative's company in Nepal. From the moment I reached out, Expert Representative was extremely responsive via email and chat, helping to arrange every detail from arrival to departure, including city tours and a lovely welcome dinner. The hotels in Kathmandu and Pokhara were absolutely top-class - the best available. The lodges up to Chhomrong were comfortable and deluxe, and the lodges for the following three nights, though more basic due to the remote location, were still the best available. I appreciated having hot showers, nearby toilets, and access to drinking water even in those high-altitude areas. Despite some bad weather, our guide and porter remained kind, caring, and incredibly helpful. The helicopter pickup at ABC was on time and made for a smooth and scenic return to Pokhara. This trek was short, beautiful, and well-paced - with no altitude sickness, lots of delicious food choices, plenty of hot drinks, and excellent overall service. The views from Annapurna Base Camp were absolutely breathtaking - a truly unforgettable experience. Huge thanks to Expert Representative and his team for organizing such a fantastic trek. We're already planning to return for another adventure soon! Rob, China", "country": "china"}]	5.0	27	2026-10-23 20:31:04.764319+06
34	Luxury Annapurna Circuit Trek	luxury-annapurna-circuit-trek	14 Days Guided Himalayan Adventure	luxury-trekking	Annapurna	luxury-nepal-trekking-tours	14	2700	3000	3645	4050	Moderate	5,416m (Thorong La) / 4,130m (ABC)	Spring (Mar-May) & Autumn (Sep-Nov)	5-Star City Hotels & Luxury Mountain Lodges	Full Board (Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner) on Trek	2 – 12 Guests (Private or Small Group)	t	luxury	/images/upload/package/luxury-annapurna-circuit-trek.jpg	["/images/upload/package/slider/luxury-annapurna-circuit-trek.jpg"]	<div class="flex-1 overflow-hidden">\r\n<div class="h-full">\r\n<div class="react-scroll-to-bottom--css-ddprw-79elbk h-full">\r\n<div class="react-scroll-to-bottom--css-ddprw-1n7m0yu">\r\n<div class="flex flex-col text-sm md:pb-9">\r\n<div class="m-auto text-base py-[18px] px-3 md:px-4 w-full md:px-5 lg:px-4 xl:px-5">\r\n<div class="mx-auto flex flex-1 gap-4 text-base md:gap-5 lg:gap-6 md:max-w-3xl">\r\n<div class="group/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn">\r\n<div class="flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3">\r\n<div class="flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow">\r\n<div class="min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5" data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="daf5ed11-8611-4a17-949e-2f91a8997d64" data-message-model-slug="gpt-4o-mini" dir="auto">\r\n<div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]">\r\n<div class="markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light">\r\n<p><span style="font-size:20px"><strong>Luxury Annapurna Circuit Trek - 14&nbsp;Days</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="color:#B22222"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>What is the Luxury Annapurna Circuit Trek &amp; What Makes it Luxury?</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:16px">The Luxury Annapurna Circuit Trek is considered one of the premier trekking trails in the Annapurna region of Nepal. This 14-day trek offers an exceptional combination of comfort and adventure. Here&rsquo;s what makes it truly luxurious:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Accommodations</strong>: Enjoy stays at the best-selected lodges featuring attached bathrooms and running hot showers throughout the trek.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Comfortable Transportation</strong>: Experience private vehicle transfers and domestic flights to enhance your travel comfort. For the first two days, as well as on Day 11 and Day 13, you will travel by private jeep or car.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Top-Notch Hotels</strong>: Stay in carefully chosen top 5-star hotels in both Kathmandu and Pokhara, ensuring a luxurious experience before and after your trek.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Expert Guidance</strong>: Your journey will be led by a local guide and porter with at least ten years of experience, ensuring you receive the best quality service.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Unmatched Luxury</strong>: Our focus on providing the highest quality service throughout the trek aims to make it one of the most luxurious trekking experiences of your life.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:16px">Join us for the Luxury Annapurna Circuit Trek and experience the breathtaking beauty of the Annapurna region in unparalleled comfort!</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class="mb-2 flex gap-3 empty:hidden -ml-2">\r\n<div class="items-center justify-start rounded-xl p-1 flex">\r\n<div class="flex items-center">\r\n<div class="flex items-center pb-0"><span style="color:#B22222"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>Why Should You Book a Annapurna Circuit Luxury Trek with Us?</strong></span></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:16px">There are several important reasons to choose us for your Annapurna Circuit Luxury&nbsp;Trek:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Highest Quality Trekking Service</strong>: Enjoy carefully selected lodges, hygienic meals, and comfortable vehicles for all your transfers, ensuring a seamless travel experience.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Well-Designed Itinerary</strong>: Our thoughtfully crafted itinerary prioritizes safety and comfort, allowing you to fully enjoy your luxury trekking experience in Nepal.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Cultural Immersion</strong>: Experience the vibrant cultures, traditions, and religious sites throughout your journey, adding depth to your adventure.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Safe High Pass Crossing</strong>: Cross the highest pass in the Annapurna region, Thorong La Pass (5416m), with expert guidance and support for your safety.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Comprehensive Exploration</strong>: Discover the historical, traditional, and natural wonders of ancient Kathmandu, Pokhara, and the Annapurna Circuit, one of Nepal&#39;s premier trekking trails.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:16px">Join us for an unforgettable adventure that combines luxury with the breathtaking beauty of the Annapurna region!</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="color:#B22222"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>Is This Trekking for Me? How Difficult is the Luxury Annapurna Circuit Trek?</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:16px">The Luxury Annapurna Circuit Trek begins in the lowland area of Besisahar and includes crossing Thorong La Pass (5416m), the highest pass in the Annapurna region. In terms of difficulty, this trek is considered moderate to mildly challenging.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:16px">To prepare for the trek, we recommend daily exercise to ensure you&#39;re fit enough for the journey. You&#39;ll need to be ready to walk a minimum of 5 hours, with some days requiring up to 9 hours (especially on high pass days). Engaging in regular activities such as running, cycling, or walking for 1-2 hours each day will help improve your fitness level.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:16px">This trek is suitable for newcomers as well as those without prior trekking experience, making it a great opportunity for anyone eager to explore the breathtaking Annapurna region!</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="color:#B22222"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>The Best Time for the Luxury lodge&nbsp;Annapurna Circuit trek:</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:16px">The ideal months for the Luxury lodge&nbsp;Annapurna Circuit Trek are from October to December in the autumn season and from March to May in the spring season. Among these, the best months for crystal-clear weather and stunning photography are October, November, April, and May.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:16px">June and September offer less crowded trekking conditions, making them a good choice for those seeking a quieter experience. While July and August are considered the rainy season, some trekkers still choose to embark on their journeys during this time to enjoy the lush greenery that the monsoon brings.</span></p>	Luxury Annapurna Circuit Trek - 14 Days What is the Luxury Annapurna Circuit Trek & What Makes it Luxury? The Luxury Annapurna Circuit Trek is considered one of the premier trekking trails in the Annapurna region of Nepal. This 14-day trek offers an exceptional combination of comfort and adventure. Here's what makes it truly luxurious: Accommodations : Enjoy stays at the best-selected lodges featuring attached bathrooms and running hot showers throughout the trek. Comfortable Transportation : Experience private vehicle transfers and domestic flights to enhance your travel comfort. For the first two days, as well as on Day 11 and Day 13, you will travel by private jeep or car. Top-Notch Hotels : Stay in carefully chosen top 5-star hotels in both Kathmandu and Pokhara, ensuring a luxurious experience before and after your trek. Expert Guidance : Your journey will be led by a local guide and porter with at least ten years of experience, ensuring you receive the best quality service. Unmatched Luxury : Our focus on providing the highest quality service throughout the trek aims to make it one of the most luxurious trekking experiences of your life. Join us for the Luxury Annapurna Circu	<p><span style="color:#B22222"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>Highlights of the Luxury Annapurna Circuit Trek</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<div class="flex-1 overflow-hidden">\r\n<div class="h-full">\r\n<div class="react-scroll-to-bottom--css-ddprw-79elbk h-full">\r\n<div class="react-scroll-to-bottom--css-ddprw-1n7m0yu">\r\n<div class="flex flex-col text-sm md:pb-9">\r\n<div class="m-auto text-base py-[18px] px-3 md:px-4 w-full md:px-5 lg:px-4 xl:px-5">\r\n<div class="mx-auto flex flex-1 gap-4 text-base md:gap-5 lg:gap-6 md:max-w-3xl">\r\n<div class="group/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn">\r\n<div class="flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3">\r\n<div class="flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow">\r\n<div class="min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5" data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="1eadf0a1-151c-4530-98fc-2291d04716bc" data-message-model-slug="gpt-4o-mini" dir="auto">\r\n<div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]">\r\n<div class="markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light">\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>First of Its Kind:</strong> Experience the first luxury trekking package in the Annapurna Circuit, designed with our clients&#39; holiday value in mind.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Luxury Accommodations:</strong> Enjoy stays in the best-selected Luxury&nbsp;lodges, featuring hot showers and attached bathrooms for your comfort.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Luxury Hotels:</strong> Relax in top 5-star hotels in Kathmandu and Pokhara, ensuring a luxurious experience throughout your journey.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Comfortable Transportation:</strong> Travel in style with a private deluxe car or Jeep to enhance your trekking experience.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Well-Prepared Itinerary:</strong> Benefit from a carefully crafted itinerary that prioritizes safe acclimatization and comfortable trekking.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Comprehensive Itinerary:</strong> The 14-day trek includes highlights such as the Muktinath Temple, natural hot springs, sunrise views from Poonhill, and a final luxury lodge stay in Ghandruk.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Healthy Dining:</strong> Enjoy daily meals that are both healthy and hygienic at the lodges.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Best Value and Service:</strong> Experience the best trekking itinerary, accommodations, and service for a memorable adventure in the Annapurna region</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	<p><span style="color:rgb(139, 69, 19)"><span style="font-size:18px"><span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"><strong>Comfortable, Luxury&nbsp;accommodations and hygienic meals</strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">Luxury 5-star ( <strong>Marriot</strong><span style="color:rgb(128, 0, 0)"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>&nbsp;hotel)</strong></span></span>&nbsp;Hotel accommodation in&nbsp;<span style="color:rgb(139, 69, 19)"><strong>KATHMANDU&nbsp;o</strong></span>n twin share with breakfast&nbsp;<span style="color:rgb(139, 69, 19)">(2<strong>&nbsp;nights)</strong></span></span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">Luxury 5-star (&nbsp;<span style="color:rgb(128, 0, 0)"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>Fishtail lodge or Temple tree- deluxe room</strong></span></span>) Hotel accommodation in&nbsp;<span style="color:rgb(139, 69, 19)"><strong>POKHARA</strong></span>&nbsp;on twin share with breakfast&nbsp;<span style="color:rgb(128, 0, 0)">(1<strong>&nbsp;nights)</strong></span></span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(128, 0, 0)"><strong>1 nights at a Luxury Hotel</strong></span>&nbsp;in Muktinath<u><strong>( Lo Mustang Himalayan Resort)&nbsp;</strong></u>with an attached bathroom,including hot and cold shower.</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(128, 0, 0)"><strong>1 nights at a Luxury Hotel</strong></span>&nbsp; in Tatopani<u><strong>( Hotel Natural Spring)&nbsp;</strong></u>with an attached bathroom,including hot and cold shower.</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(128, 0, 0)"><strong>1 nights at a Luxury Hotel</strong></span>&nbsp; in Besisahar<u><strong>( Gateway Himalayan Resort)&nbsp;</strong></u>with an attached bathroom,including hot and cold shower.</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(128, 0, 0)"><strong>3 nights at a Luxury&nbsp;mountain lodg</strong><span style="font-size:18px">e&nbsp;or guest house</span></span>&nbsp; in Chame, manang<u><strong>(Mountain lodges of Nepal- MLN&nbsp;)&nbsp;</strong></u>with an attached bathroom,including hot and cold shower.</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(139, 69, 19)"><strong>3 nights at the best selected/available eco lodge</strong></span>&nbsp;or guest house with a common bathroom including hot and cold showers.</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">There are 3 hygienic vegetarian or non-vegetarian meals per day: breakfast, lunch, and dinner (you can choose meals from all over the Lodge every day).</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">Tea/coffee or other hot beverages during breakfast, lunch, and dinner (5&ndash;6 cups per day).</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">seasonal fruits and additional biscuit/cookies snacks&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:18px">Where available, there is free WiFi.</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:18px">4-5 liters of boiled or purified drinking water.</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:18px">Charges for a camera, smartphone, or laptop&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="color:rgb(139, 69, 19)"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>Private transportation that is comfortable</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">private, comfortable vehicle tour of Kathmandu city &amp; Pokhara City&nbsp;as specified in the itinerary.</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">All airport transfers by private, comfortable vehicle (international and domestic airport pick-up and drop-off as included in the itinerary).</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="color:rgb(139, 69, 19)"><strong>&nbsp;Kathmandu- Besisahar by Private CAR</strong></span>( Before&nbsp;trek)- 5 hours</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="color:#800000"><span style="font-size:18px">Besisahar- Chame by Private Jeep( 3 hrs)</span></span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="color:#800000"><span style="font-size:18px">Muktinath temple to Tatopani by private Jeep( 5 hrs)</span></span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="color:#800000"><span style="font-size:18px">Ghandruk- Pokhara by Private Jeep( 4 hrs)</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="color:rgb(139, 69, 19)"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>baggage allowance and domestic flights.</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><span style="color:rgb(47, 79, 79)"><strong><span style="font-size:14px"><span style="font-size:16px">Pokhara-Kathmandu flight tickets</span></span></strong></span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:14px"><span style="font-size:16px">The baggage allowance on the Pokhara&nbsp;flight is 15 kg, and we include 5 kg extra for free, for a total of 20 kg per person</span>.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="color:rgb(139, 69, 19)"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>Professional Private Expert Representatives &amp; porters</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">professional English-speaking tour guide for sightseeing in the city as specified in the itinerary.</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">A professional English-speaking guide for the trek</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">Porter who is professional, dependable, helpful, and friendly (1 porter for every two people sharing)</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">Daily wage, lodging, meals, and guide and porter insurance.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="color:rgb(139, 69, 19)"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>Trekking permits and entrance fees</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">Entrance fees to all UNESCO heritage sites during city sightseeing in Kathmandu and Pokhara</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">Annapurna conservation Area Project( ACAP)&nbsp;Entrance&nbsp;Fee</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">The local government fee</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">Trekker&rsquo;s information management system (TIMS) fee</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="color:rgb(139, 69, 19)"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>Free information or guest services.</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">guide to purchasing trekking clothing or equipment, as well as any other required wholesale shopping in Kathmandu.</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">Support in the case of baggage loss or delay in Kathmandu from international flights to Nepal</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">Support to exchange money, get a local SIM card</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">24/7 emergency call support.</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">Free safe baggage storage service during the trek</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="color:rgb(139, 69, 19)"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>Free welcome dinner &amp; farewell professional body massage after the trek</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">We offer a free welcome Nepalese dinner with authentic Nepalese cultural dances on arrival day, or if you arrive late on arrival night, this will be provided on the second day.</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">After the trek, you will receive a FREE 1-hour Ayurvedic full-body massage as a treatment for your tired body.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="color:rgb(139, 69, 19)"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>Other free services include:</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">A down sleeping bag and a down jacket are provided at no cost.</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">Free use of water bottles</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">Free use of trekking poles</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">Free use of porter duffel bags (you can take them after the trek if you like).</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">First Aid Kit</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">Trekking certificate</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">Trekking Map</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">The company&#39;s gift</span></li>\r\n</ul>	<ul style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-left: 0px; color: rgb(82, 82, 82); font-family: domine, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: rgb(254, 254, 254);">\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">Nepal Visa-US $ 50</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">International Flight to/from Kathmandu/home</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">Travel and Emergency Helicopter Evacuation Insurance</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">Meals (Lunch and Dinner) and other expenses in Kathmandu and Pokhara (hotel breakfast included)</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">Any soft drinks or alcoholic drinks during the trek, internet bills, dessert items, except for breakfast, lunch, and dinner, extra tea/coffee or foods</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">Laundry or personal expenses like internet WIFI, unforeseen costs due to natural disasters, sickness, flight delays, bad weather, urgent helicopter evacuation etc.</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">Trekking gear and clothing</span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style="font-size:16px">Tips for guides and porters</span></li>\r\n</ul>		[{"label": "1 Traveler (Solo Private)", "maxPax": 1, "minPax": 1, "deluxePrice": 2950, "luxuryPrice": 2949}, {"label": "2 – 3 Travelers", "maxPax": 3, "minPax": 2, "deluxePrice": 2700, "luxuryPrice": 2599}, {"label": "4 – 6 Travelers", "maxPax": 6, "minPax": 4, "deluxePrice": 2511, "luxuryPrice": 2417}, {"label": "7 – 12 Travelers (Group)", "maxPax": 12, "minPax": 7, "deluxePrice": 2349, "luxuryPrice": 2261}]	[{"day": 1, "mea