 ( B + L+D)", "walking": "5-6 hour Trekking", "altitude": "3519m", "distance": "14 km via Upper Pisang Trail", "description": "Full guided day in the Himalayas with luxury lodge hospitality and scenic trails.", "accommodation": "MLN lodge or Tilicho Hotel ( B + L+D)", "transportation": "On Foot / Trekking"}, {"day": 6, "meal": "Breakfast + Lunch + Dinner(B/L/D)", "title": "Day 06: Acclimatization extra day in Manang, Hike to Lake or Hill Monastery- MLN lodge or Tilicho Hotel ( B + L+D)", "walking": "2-3 hours hiking", "altitude": "3519m", "distance": "4 km", "description": "Full guided day in the Himalayas with luxury lodge hospitality and scenic trails.", "accommodation": "MLN lodge or Tilicho Hotel ( B + L+D)", "transportation": "On Foot / Trekking"}, {"day": 7, "meal": "Breakfast + Lunch + Dinner(B/L/D)", "title": "Day 07: Trek from Manang to Yak Kharka (4200M) - 4/5 hrs- Hotel Himalayan View or Similar (B+L+D)", "walking": "4-5 hours Trekking", "altitude": "4030m", "distance": "10.8 km", "description": "Full guided day in the Himalayas with luxury lodge hospitality and scenic trails.", "accommodation": "Hotel Himalayan View or Similar (B+L+D)", "transportation": "On Foot / Trekking"}, {"day": 8, "meal": "Breakfast + Lunch + Dinner(B/L/D)", "title": "Day 08: Trek from Yak Kharka to Throng Phedi (4533)- 3-4 hrs- Thorong Base Camp Lodge or Similar(B+L+D)", "walking": "3- 4 hours Trekking", "altitude": "4533m", "distance": "6 km", "description": "Full guided day in the Himalayas with luxury lodge hospitality and scenic trails.", "accommodation": "Thorong Base Camp Lodge or Similar(B+L+D)", "transportation": "On Foot / Trekking"}, {"day": 9, "meal": "Breakfast + Lunch + Dinner(B/L/D)", "title": "Day 09: Trek from Throng Phedi to Throng-La pass (5416m)-Trek down to Muktinath (3760M)- 9-10 hrs- Lo Mustang Himalayan Resort( TOP Luxury) (B+L+D", "walking": "9-10 hour trekking", "altitude": "3760m", "distance": "15.1 km", "description": "Full guided day in the Himalayas with luxury lodge hospitality and scenic trails.", "accommodation": "Lo Mustang Himalayan Resort( TOP Luxury) (B+L+D", "transportation": "On Foot / Trekking"}, {"day": 10, "meal": "Breakfast + Lunch + Dinner(B/L/D)", "title": "Day 10: Private Jeep drive Muktinath to Tatopani( 1268m) by private Jeep –4/5 hrs- Hotel Natural Spring( Top Luxury) (B+L+D", "walking": "5-6 hours", "altitude": "1268 m", "distance": "76 km Drive by Jeep", "description": "Full guided day in the Himalayas with luxury lodge hospitality and scenic trails.", "accommodation": "Hotel Natural Spring( Top Luxury) (B+L+D", "transportation": "4-5 hours Private Jeep"}, {"day": 11, "meal": "Breakfast + Lunch + Dinner(B/L/D)", "title": "Day 11:  Long day trek from Tatopani to Ghorepani (2874m)-7/9 hrs- Hotel Snowland or Similar (B+L+D", "walking": "7-9 hours Trekking", "altitude": "2874m", "distance": "16 km", "description": "Full guided day in the Himalayas with luxury lodge hospitality and scenic trails.", "accommodation": "Hotel Snowland or Similar (B+L+D", "transportation": "On Foot / Trekking"}, {"day": 12, "meal": "Breakfast + Lunch + Dinner(B/L/D)", "title": "Day 12: Sunrise hike to Poonhil (3210M) & Trek to Ulleri( 5 hrs), drive to Pokhara 3 hrs", "walking": "5-6 hours trekking", "altitude": "820", "distance": "15 km", "description": "Full guided day in the Himalayas with luxury lodge hospitality and scenic trails.", "accommodation": "Fishtail Lodge or Temple tree resort (B + B)- Luxury Hotel", "transportation": "3 hrs drive"}, {"day": 13, "meal": "Lavish Breakfast", "title": "Day 13: After Lavish breakfast at hotel,Half day sightseeing in Pokhara city,( 3 hrs) until 2-3 pm, then fly to Kathmandu, Transfer to hotel- Hotel Marriot( B+B)", "walking": "-", "altitude": "1340m", "distance": "10-12 km", "description": "Full guided day in the Himalayas with luxury lodge hospitality and scenic trails.", "accommodation": "Hotel Marriot( B+B)- 5* Luxury Hotel", "transportation": "Private car tour + Flights"}, {"day": 14, "meal": "Lavish Breakfast", "title": "Day 14: Breakfast at hotel, drive to Airport and fly to your home, see you again", "walking": "-", "altitude": "1400m", "distance": "10-12 km", "description": "Full guided day in the Himalayas with luxury lodge hospitality and scenic trails.", "accommodation": "5-Star Luxury Mountain Lodge", "transportation": "Private car to Airport"}]	[{"id": 41, "price": 2700, "status": "Guaranteed", "endDate": "2026-11-15", "spotsLeft": 6, "startDate": "2026-11-01"}, {"id": 42, "price": 2700, "status": "Available", "endDate": "2026-11-29", "spotsLeft": 8, "startDate": "2026-11-15"}, {"id": 43, "price": 2700, "status": "Available", "endDate": "2026-12-19", "spotsLeft": 10, "startDate": "2026-12-05"}, {"id": 44, "price": 2700, "status": "Available", "endDate": "2027-03-24", "spotsLeft": 12, "startDate": "2027-03-10"}, {"id": 45, "price": 2700, "status": "Guaranteed", "endDate": "2027-04-16", "spotsLeft": 5, "startDate": "2027-04-02"}]	[]	[{"id": 7, "date": "2022-07-24", "title": "David", "author": "Luxury Annapurna Circuit Trek", "rating": 5, "comment": "Hello, There are many annapurna circuit trek packages by different companies on the internet. After very careful research, we selected Luxury annapurna circuit trek advertised by Expert Representative's company. from the beginning of the trek planning to booking, he is so professional for quick response and everything has been arranged so well. we had nice hot showers in most of nights in trek except few nights during throngla pass. the local jeep drive was nice in the begining and after throng la pass as we got bit tired from the trek. rest day hotspring( tatopani) is perfect for relax after long circuit. poonhill is fabulous place to see full mountain ranges. about lodges, it is all nice and most important for this great trek is because of our so friendly and helpful guide and porter. we highly reccomend this trek and Expert Representative's company to everyone and we will do another trek again. Best wishes, David", "country": "Australia"}, {"id": 61, "date": "2025-04-20", "title": "Tina", "author": "The best Annapurna circuit luxury trek", "rating": 5, "comment": "In March 2025, I completed the Annapurna Circuit Luxury Trek with Nepal Trekking Tourism & Adventure along with my husband and two friends from California. Before choosing this trek, I had exchanged many emails with several companies, comparing services and accommodations. Our main priority was luxury lodges with attached bathrooms and hot showers, and through our research, we found this package - and we're so glad we did! Expert Representative was extremely helpful throughout the planning process, always willing to answer questions and negotiate details to match our needs. Our guide, Mingmar, along with our two amazing porters, Ngima and Wangyal, were the heart of this experience. They took great care of our well-being, kept us entertained, made us laugh, played cards, and even sang songs along the way - making it a truly joyful trek. Most nights, we stayed in the best lodges available, all with hot showers, private bathrooms, and comfortable beds. Even in higher altitude areas like Yak Kharka and Thorong Phedi, where options are limited, we still had attached toilets - a huge plus in the cold! The 5-star hotel in Muktinath after crossing Thorong La Pass was an unexpected and delightful surprise. From there to Pokhara, we continued staying in excellent lodges. The hotels in Kathmandu and Pokhara were also top-tier. I can confidently say this was a true luxury Annapurna Circuit trek, and every dollar was well worth it. These 17 days were some of our best experiences in Nepal, thanks to NETTA and their professional, kind-hearted team. We will definitely come back again and highly recommend this company to anyone looking to trek in Nepal. Tina & Team California, USA", "country": "usa"}, {"id": 62, "date": "2025-04-20", "title": " Mark", "author": "The Best Luxury Annapurna Circuit Trek – A Perfect Experience", "rating": 5, "comment": "The Annapurna Circuit Luxury Trek has been the best trekking experience for our group. This trek offered high-quality lodges along the trail, healthy meals, a well-planned itinerary, and comfortable transportation throughout the journey. We are a group of 12 Canadian trekkers who wanted a comfortable and well-supported trek in Nepal. Through a friend's recommendation, we found Expert Representative and his company, CCC Nepal Trekking Tours - and we're so glad we did! Expert Representative was extremely helpful and responsive in organizing this trek for us, taking care of every detail from start to finish. We were supported by a wonderful team of Expert Representatives and hardworking porters who made sure everything went smoothly. Their service was outstanding - we were well taken care of every single day, and there were no issues at all during the trek. This is truly the best luxury Annapurna Circuit itinerary offered by NETTA, and we would highly recommend it to anyone looking for a comfortable, scenic, and unforgettable trekking experience in Nepal. Mark and Team Canada", "country": "canada"}, {"id": 63, "date": "2025-04-20", "title": "Linda", "author": "wonderful Annapurna circuit luxury trek", "rating": 5, "comment": "Namaste Expert Representative and Team, Thank you so much for your personalized service throughout our trek. We had a wonderful experience trekking the Annapurna Circuit , and it wouldn't have been the same without your amazing support. Your Expert Representative Team is truly one of the best - professional, kind, and always looking out for us. We're already looking forward to seeing you again for another adventure in Nepal! Best regards, Linda, UK", "country": "UK"}, {"id": 64, "date": "2025-04-20", "title": "Anne", "author": "Luxury Annapurna circuit trek", "rating": 5, "comment": "Hello Expert Representative, Thank you for your email. We have just returned to Germany after completing our Annapurna Circuit trek in March 2025, and I wanted to let you know that we all had a wonderful experience. Everything went smoothly - no issues at all, and thankfully, none of us experienced any altitude problems. All five of our group members successfully crossed Thorong La Pass, and we're very proud of that! Thank you for the well-designed itinerary, the high-quality service, and the unlimited delicious food during the trek. Every detail - from drinking water, lodges, rooms, hotels, to the bus arrangements - was thoughtfully organized. We are all very happy and grateful for this unforgettable journey. Thank you once again! Warm regards, Anne and Team Germany", "country": "Germany"}]	5.0	25	2026-10-23 20:31:04.764319+06
37	Luxury Annapurna Experience Trek	luxury-annapurna-experience-trek	The best short treks in Lap of Mt. Annapurna- Don't miss this incredible trek	luxury-trekking	Annapurna	luxury-nepal-trekking-tours	9	2355	2700	3179	3533	Easy to Moderate	5,416m (Thorong La) / 4,130m (ABC)	Spring (Mar-May) & Autumn (Sep-Nov)	5-Star City Hotels & Luxury Mountain Lodges	Full Board (Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner) on Trek	2 – 12 Guests (Private or Small Group)	f	luxury	/images/upload/package/luxury-annapurna-experience-trek.jpg	["/images/upload/package/slider/luxury-annapurna-experience-trek.jpg"]	<p><span style="font-size:20px"><strong>9-Day Luxury Annapurna Experience Trek</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="color:#B22222"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>What is the Luxury Annapurna Experience Trek &amp; What Makes It Luxury?</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:16px">The <strong>Luxury Annapurna Experience Trek</strong> is an upgraded, luxurious version of our regular <a href="https://www.nepaltrekkingtours.com/deluxe-mulde-peak-ghorepani-poonhill-trek">deluxe Mulde Peak Ghorepani trek</a>, designed to provide you with unparalleled comfort amidst the breathtaking beauty of the Annapurna region. You will be welcomed by some of the finest lodges in Dhampus, Landruk, and Ghandruk, all managed by Ker and Downey.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:16px">This itinerary features longer trekking days than our standard routes, allowing you to reach the best lodges and a luxurious 5-star hotel in Pokhara. We provide comfortable private jeep transfers to and from Pokhara to the trek&#39;s starting and ending points.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:16px">Over the course of 9 days, this luxury trek also includes valuable sightseeing opportunities in both Kathmandu and Pokhara. The ultimate goal of this trek is to capture unforgettable sunrise views of more than 12 of the world&#39;s highest mountains from Poonhill, the highest point of the trek.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:16px">With 25 years of experience, we offer a meticulously planned itinerary to ensure you enjoy the best of short, easy-moderate, and luxurious trekking in the Annapurna region of Nepal.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="color:#B22222"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>Why Should You Book the Luxury Annapurna view&nbsp;Trek with Us?</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:16px">The itinerary for the <strong>Luxury Annapurna view&nbsp;Trek</strong> follows a stunning trail to Ghorepani, offering true mountain views. It is an easy to moderate trekking route that features the best lodges, ensuring top-level comfort in the mountains. Here are a few reasons to book this trek with us:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Exceptional Accommodations:</strong> Enjoy the best lodges with private bathrooms and hot showers, along with a selection of hygienic meals.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Luxury in Pokhara and Kathmandu:</strong> The itinerary includes two nights in Pokhara at a top-rated 5-star hotel and two nights in Kathmandu at another top-rated 5-star hotel, complete with the best sightseeing and access to cultural or natural sites.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Accessibility for All Trekkers:</strong> This trek is beneficial for trekkers of all levels, making it an inclusive experience.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Expert Guidance:</strong> Trek with a local expert with 25 years of experience, ensuring you have the best trekking experience in Nepa</span>l.</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="color:#B22222"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>Is This Trekking for Me? How Difficult is the Luxury Annapurna Experience Trek?</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:16px">Yes, this trek is suitable for everyone! It is categorized as an easy to moderately difficult trek in Nepal, with no age limit. If you are physically fit and comfortable walking 4 to 9 hours a day at a moderate pace, you are welcome to join.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:16px">The first three days of the trek feature shorter walks of a maximum of 5 hours each, while the trek from Ghandruk to Ghorepani involves a longer hike of about 8&ndash;9 hours. Among the short and easy treks in Nepal, this is one of the best options available.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:16px">We invite you to join us for an unforgettable holiday experience!</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="color:#B22222"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>The Best Season for the Luxury Annapurna view&nbsp;Trek</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:16px">This trek is possible year-round. However, for the best photography and weather conditions, we recommend visiting Nepal for this trek from September to December and February to June. The finest months for weather are typically October, November, December, as well as April and May.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="font-size:16px">If you prefer a less crowded experience, trekking in February, June, or September is highly recommended.</span></p>	9-Day Luxury Annapurna Experience Trek What is the Luxury Annapurna Experience Trek & What Makes It Luxury? The Luxury Annapurna Experience Trek is an upgraded, luxurious version of our regular deluxe Mulde Peak Ghorepani trek , designed to provide you with unparalleled comfort amidst the breathtaking beauty of the Annapurna region. You will be welcomed by some of the finest lodges in Dhampus, Landruk, and Ghandruk, all managed by Ker and Downey. This itinerary features longer trekking days than our standard routes, allowing you to reach the best lodges and a luxurious 5-star hotel in Pokhara. We provide comfortable private jeep transfers to and from Pokhara to the trek's starting and ending points. Over the course of 9 days, this luxury trek also includes valuable sightseeing opportunities in both Kathmandu and Pokhara. The ultimate goal of this trek is to capture unforgettable sunrise views of more than 12 of the world's highest mountains from Poonhill, the highest point of the trek. With 25 years of experience, we offer a meticulously planned itinerary to ensure you enjoy the best of short, easy-moderate, and luxurious trekking in the Annapurna region of Nepal. Why Should You Bo	<p><span style="color:#B22222"><span style="font-size:20px"><strong>Highlights of the Luxury Annapurna Experience Trek</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>First of Its Kind:</strong> Experience the Annapurna region in a luxurious style, often referred to as the Annapurna View Trek.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Accessible for All Ages:</strong> This trek is one of the shortest easy to moderate treks, suitable for everyone, including kids and those aged 80&ndash;85 years.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Well-Prepared Itinerary:</strong> Enjoy a thoughtfully crafted itinerary that features the best luxury and deluxe lodges along the trek.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Top-Quality Accommodations:</strong> Stay at Nepal&#39;s top 5-star hotels in both Kathmandu and Pokhara.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Cultural and Natural Tours:</strong> Delight in included tours that showcase the natural beauty and rich culture of Pokhara and Kathmandu.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Designed for Relaxation:</strong> This trek is specifically designed for an easy trekking vacation that is both enjoyable and rewarding.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Best Value 