urna Experience Trek", "rating": 5, "comment": "Hi Expert Representative, Thanks for your email about our Nepal trip experience. Our family trip to Annapurna experience you have recommended is very nice. My two children, myself and my husband all had a wonderful holiday in Nepal. We enjoyed the trip to Kathmandu, Pokhara and the short trek around Annapurna. The Luxury lodges you have booked for us are very clean with hot water. Our guide made all the meals and necessary rooms requirements well in the trek. The hotel in Pokhara is very beautiful and Kathmandu is the best. Thank you very much for all your assistance. Hope to see you again and I will recommend your company to my friends. Sincerely yours, Richard Morgan", "country": "Dubai"}]	5.0	27	2026-10-23 20:31:04.764319+06
7	Deluxe Gokyo Everest Base Camp Trek	deluxe-gokyo-everest-base-camp-trek	The best suggested itinerary in Everest region- Highly recommended	deluxe-trekking	Everest	deluxe-nepal-trekking-tours	17	2266	2400	2366	2650	Moderate	5,545m (Kala Patthar)	Spring (Mar-May) & Autumn (Sep-Nov)	4-Star City Hotel & Deluxe Attached-Bath Lodges	Full Board (Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner) on Trek	2 – 12 Guests (Private or Small Group)	f	bestseller	/images/upload/package/deluxe-gokyo-everest-base-camp-trek.jpg	["/images/upload/package/slider/deluxe-gokyo-everest-base-camp-trek.jpg"]	<p><span style="font-size:22px"><strong>Deluxe Gokyo Everest Base Camp Trek-17&nbsp;days</strong></span>&nbsp; &gt;&gt; <em><span style="font-size:16px">The Best trekking holiday package in Nepal</span></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style="color:#A52A2A"><span style="font-size:18px">What exactly is the Deluxe Gokyo Everest Base Camp Trek? What distinguishes it as deluxe?</span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p class="root-block-node" data-changed="false" data-paragraphid="298"><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>The Deluxe Gokyo Lake Everest Base Camp Trek</strong>&nbsp;is a 17-day,the most popular moderate-level trek in the Everest region. This trek joins two beautiful trekking areas of the Khumbu region&mdash;the Gokyo lake area and the Everest base camp area. In other words, this is a bit longer trekking route than our deluxe Everest base camp trek. The best part of this trek is that you will trek up to Namche Bazaar and then follow the trail to Gokyo Lake. After a well-deserved excursion to Gokyo Ri (5420m), hiking the highest view point in the Gokyo valley, you will trek toward Portse, a beautiful sherpa village, and meet the direct trail to Everest base camp and Kalapatthar at Pangboche. Alternatively, this trek can go over the Chola pass to Everest base camp, but we follow the trekking route down to Pangboche and then follow the regular trail to Everest base camp.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class="root-block-node" data-changed="false" data-paragraphid="299"><span style="font-size:16px">Since we are not going to cross the Chola pass on this trek, the&nbsp;<strong>Deluxe Gokyo Lake Everest base camp trek</strong>&nbsp;is suitable for any aged group of trekkers with minimum physical fitness and full mental preparedness. During the whole trek, we accommodate you at the best available deluxe lodges where there are attached bathrooms and hot showers. This 3-week trek of Gokyo valley and Kala Patthar plus Everest base camp offers the best trekking and hiking experience in Nepal.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class="root-block-node" data-changed="false" data-paragraphid="300"><span style="color:#A52A2A"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>Why should you book a Deluxe Gokyo Lake Everest Base Camp Trek with us?&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class="root-block-node" data-changed="false" data-paragraphid="301"><span style="font-size:16px">Most of the regular itineraries you can find are not well designed for altitude acclimatization or a level of comfort on a high mountain trail like Everest, but our deluxe Gokyo to Everest base camp trek itinerary is best designed to be comfortable and enjoyable. We will accommodate you in a deluxe category lodge wherever possible for a comfortable night&#39;s sleep in the mountains. The quality of food served will be the best to make sure you have fresh, hygienic meals every day on trek. Our Expert Representatives and porters have more than 15 years of experience on this trail and will assist you on a wonderful trekking holiday. All the hotels in Kathmandu city, transportation, quality of lodges on trek, and quality of service from our sherpas make your trek really deluxe in the mountains. Last but not least, we offer the best value at the lowest possible cost.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="color:#A52A2A"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>Is this trek for me? How difficult is this trek?</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class="root-block-node" data-changed="false" data-paragraphid="303"><span style="font-size:16px">This 19-day trek is a moderate-level trek. The&nbsp;<em>highest</em>&nbsp;point of this trek is Kala Patthar, at 5643m. You are not going to cross any high passes on this trek. So, if you have the habit of hiking or trekking for a minimum of 5-7 hours, this trek is easy for you. A well-planned itinerary is essential for proper acclimatization. Most days, you are trekking for less than 5&ndash;6 hours a day. It does not matter whether you have previous trekking experience or not, this trek is for all mountain trekking enthusiasts.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style="color:#A52A2A"><span style="font-size:18px"><strong>The best season for the Deluxe Gokyo Lake Everest base camp trek:</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class="root-block-node" data-changed="false" data-paragraphid="305"><span style="font-size:16px">Like all other trekking in the Everest region or other trekking regions of Nepal, the best trekking seasons are always autumn and spring. Prior to the monsoon season from mid-June to mid-September, it is cloudier and trekking is possible at high altitude. If you wish to trek in the best months, you can trek in October, November, December, March, April, May, and June.</span></p>	Deluxe Gokyo Everest Base Camp Trek-17 days &gt;&gt; The Best trekking holiday package in Nepal What exactly is the Deluxe Gokyo Everest Base Camp Trek? What distinguishes it as deluxe? The Deluxe Gokyo Lake Everest Base Camp Trek is a 17-day,the most popular moderate-level trek in the Everest region. This trek joins two beautiful trekking areas of the Khumbu region-the Gokyo lake area and the Everest base camp area. In other words, this is a bit longer trekking route than our deluxe Everest base camp trek. The best part of this trek is that you will trek up to Namche Bazaar and then follow the trail to Gokyo Lake. After a well-deserved excursion to Gokyo Ri (5420m), hiking the highest view point in th