le Lodge (B+L+D)", "transportation": "On Foot / Trekking"}, {"day": 13, "meal": "Breakfast + Lunch + Dinner( B+L+D)", "title": "Day 13: Trek from Gorakshep to Kalapattar (5644m) & Trek back down to Pheriche (4280M) - 8/9 hrs- Deluxe attached bathroom Lodge (B+ L+D)", "walking": "7-8 hours trekking", "altitude": "4371 m", "distance": "12.8 km", "description": "Full guided day in the Himalayas with luxury lodge hospitality and scenic trails.", "accommodation": "Deluxe attached bathroom Lodge (B+ L+D)", "transportation": "On Foot / Trekking"}, {"day": 14, "meal": "Breakfast + Lunch + Dinner( B+L+D)", "title": "Day 14: Trek from Pheriche to Namche (3440m)-7/8 hrs- Deluxe attached bathroom Lodge (B+L+D)", "walking": "4 hours trekking", "altitude": "3440m", "distance": "14.2 km", "description": "Full guided day in the Himalayas with luxury lodge hospitality and scenic trails.", "accommodation": "Deluxe attached bathroom Lodge (B+L+D)", "transportation": "On Foot / Trekking"}, {"day": 15, "meal": "Breakfast + Lunch + Dinner( B+L+D)", "title": "Day 15: Last day of Gokyo Everest base camp Deluxe trek: Trek from Namche to Lukla (2860m)- 7/8 hrs- Deluxe attached bathroom Lodge (B+L+D)", "walking": "7-8 hours trekking", "altitude": "2860m", "distance": "13.5 km", "description": "Full guided day in the Himalayas with luxury lodge hospitality and scenic trails.", "accommodation": "Deluxe attached bathroom Lodge (B+L+D)", "transportation": "On Foot / Trekking"}, {"day": 16, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Day 16: Early morning flight from Lukla to Kathmandu( 35 min) & Transfer to hotel, relax day at Hotel after Long Trip or Extra day tours at extra cost Deluxe Hotel (B+B)", "walking": "Free day/relax day", "altitude": "1400m", "distance": "10-12 km", "description": "Full guided day in the Himalayas with luxury lodge hospitality and scenic trails.", "accommodation": "Deluxe Hotel( B+B)", "transportation": "Flight + Private Car transfer to Hotel"}, {"day": 17, "meal": "Breakfast", "title": "Day 17: Transfer to Kathmandu TIA Airport and fly back to Home, your Beautiful Gokyo Everest base camp trek ends here today until next time, SEE YOU- B", "walking": "5-6 hours", "altitude": "3,440m / 11,286ft", "distance": "10-12 km", "description": "Full guided day in the Himalayas with luxury lodge hospitality and scenic trails.", "accommodation": "Deluxe Attached-Bath Lodge", "transportation": "Private car Transfer to Airport"}]	[{"id": 141, "price": 2266, "status": "Guaranteed", "endDate": "2026-11-15", "spotsLeft": 6, "startDate": "2026-11-01"}, {"id": 142, "price": 2266, "status": "Available", "endDate": "2026-11-29", "spotsLeft": 8, "startDate": "2026-11-15"}, {"id": 143, "price": 2266, "status": "Available", "endDate": "2026-12-19", "spotsLeft": 10, "startDate": "2026-12-05"}, {"id": 144, "price": 2266, "status": "Available", "endDate": "2027-03-24", "spotsLeft": 12, "startDate": "2027-03-10"}, {"id": 145, "price": 2266, "status": "Guaranteed", "endDate": "2027-04-16", "spotsLeft": 5, "startDate": "2027-04-02"}]	[]	[{"id": 16, "date": "2022-07-26", "title": "Dave", "author": "Deluxe Gokyo Everest Base Camp Trek", "rating": 5, "comment": "Hi Expert Representative, Thanks for your e-mail again.I would like to thank you so much for the perfect trekking service. We had a great time in Nepal. Your guide and porters are so helpful and friendly. It is so nice to visit the monastery in Tengboche, and we chose this itinerary to go to the Gokyo lakes part. It is so beautiful. We also like the itinerary that takes us through the lower altitude of Portse village and meets the regular trail to Everest base camp at Pangboche. All the other companies' itineraries include crossing the Chola Pass, which for us is more difficult, and so this itinerary perfectly worked for us. We slept soundly every night. The meals were delicious. The quality of all services is very good, and we don't have any complaints about the service. The other services in the Kathmandu hotel and city tour are very nice. All in all, we had a wonderful trip in Nepal with your company and would like to use it again. Thanks once again for this great trip for us. We would highly recommend your deluxe Gokyo Everest base camp trek to all who want to enjoy the trek in Nepal at the best price and best service from a local sherpa company. Sincerely yours, Dave", "country": "California, USA"}, {"id": 34, "date": "2024-11-19", "title": "Patricia P", "author": "\\"Wonderful Trekking Experience with CCC Nepal Trekking Tours\\"", "rating": 5, "comment": "We had a wonderful trek with CCC Nepal Trekking Tours. We thoroughly enjoyed the trek to Gokyo, crossing the Cho La Pass, and reaching Everest Base Camp. Thank you for providing such a great trekking experience. We are already planning to come back again. The hotels in Kathmandu, as well as the lodges and food during the trek, were excellent. Our guide and porter did a fantastic job, and we were fortunate to have great weather throughout the trek. The itinerary was well-planned and worked perfectly for us.", "country": "Denver"}]	5.0	21	2026-10-23 20:31:04.764319+06
17	Deluxe Best of Bhutan Tour	deluxe-best-of-bhutan-tour	10 Days Guided Himalayan Adventure	cultural-tours	Bhutan	multi-country-tour	10	1899	2241	2564	2849	Easy to Moderate	4,500m	Spring (Mar-May) & Autumn (Sep-Nov)	4-Star City Hotel & Deluxe Attached-Bath Lodges	Full Board (Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner) on Trek	2 – 12 Guests (Private or Small Group)	f	bestseller	/images/upload/package/bhutan.jpg	["/images/upload/package/slider/bhutan-banner-1.jpg"]	<p data-end="701" data-start="405"><span style="font-size:14px">The <strong>Deluxe Best of Bhutan Tour</strong> is one of the most enriching and luxurious ways to experience the hidden Himalayan kingdom of Bhutan. Spanning <strong>10 days</strong>, this comprehensive tour is designed for travelers who seek a <strong>deep cultural immersion</strong> without compromising on <strong>comfort and quality</strong>.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end="1061" data-start="703"><span style="font-size:14px">Whether you&#39;re a spiritual seeker, a nature lover, a photographer, or simply a curious traveler, this journey will take you through <strong>Bhutan&rsquo;s most iconic towns, valleys, monasteries, and dzongs</strong> &mdash; all while staying in <strong>premium 3-star deluxe and 4-star deluxe hotels</strong>, traveling in <strong>private comfortable transport</strong>, and guided by <strong>expert local guides</strong>.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end="1232" data-start="1063"><span style="font-size:14px">This is <strong>not a rushed tour</strong> &mdash; it&#39;s designed for you to fully enjoy and absorb each destination, while still covering all major cultural highlights Bhutan has to offer.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Destinations You&rsquo;ll Explore</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p data-end="1342" data-start="1280"><span style="font-size:14px">Over 10 unforgettable days, you&rsquo;ll explore the best of Bhutan:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end="2167" data-start="1344">\r\n\t<li data-end="1510" data-start="1344">\r\n\t<p data-end="1510" data-start="1346"><span style="font-size:14px"><strong>Paro</strong> &ndash; Visit the legendary <strong>Tiger&rsquo;s Nest Monastery (Taktsang)</strong>, perched dramatically on a cliffside, and explore ancient temples and the National Museum.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end="1699" data-start="1511">\r\n\t<p data-end="1699" data-start="1513"><span style="font-size:14px"><strong>Thimphu</strong> &ndash; The capital city that blends tradition and modernity, home to the <strong>Buddha Dordenma statue</strong>, traditional art schools, the Memorial Chorten, and lively local markets.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end="1851" data-start="1700">\r\n\t<p data-end="1851" data-start="1702"><span style="font-size:14px"><strong>Punakha</strong> &ndash; Witness the beauty of <strong>Punakha Dzong</strong>, considered the most stunning fortress in Bhutan, located at the confluence of two rivers.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end="2019" data-start="1852">\r\n\t<p data-end="2019" data-start="1854"><span style="font-size:14px"><strong>Gangtey (Phobjikha Valley)</strong> &ndash; A serene glacial valley and winter home of the endangered black-necked cranes. A haven for birdwatchers and nature enthusiasts.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end="2167" data-start="2020">\r\n\t<p data-end="2167" data-start="2022"><span style="font-size:14px"><strong>Bumthang Valley</strong> &ndash; Often called the <strong>spiritual heartland of Bhutan</strong>, filled with ancient monasteries, sacred sites, and rich folklore.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p data-end="2301" data-start="2169"><span style="font-size:14px">Along the way, you&rsquo;ll also visit sacred <strong>Buddhist stupas</strong>, <strong>traditional villages</strong>, and experience <strong>local customs and cuisine</strong>.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Deluxe Tour Features</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p data-end="2399" data-start="2341"><span style="font-size:14px">Here&rsquo;s why this is truly the <em>best deluxe tour of Bhutan</em>:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end="3340" data-start="2401">\r\n\t<li data-end="2610" data-start="2401">\r\n\t<p data-end="2610" data-start="2403"><span style="font-size:14px"><strong>High-quality accommodations</strong>: Stay in carefully selected 3-star deluxe or 4-star deluxe hotels in each destination, offering comfort, cleanliness, traditional Bhutanese hospitality, and excellent meals.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end="2746" data-start="2611">\r\n\t<p data-end="2746" data-start="2613"><span style="font-size:14px"><strong>Private transportation</strong>: Enjoy stress-free travel in a private vehicle with a skilled driver, allowing flexibility and comfort.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end="2918" data-start="2747">\r\n\t<p data-end="2918" data-start="2749"><span style="font-size:14px"><strong>Knowledgeable local guides</strong>: English-speaking Bhutanese guides with deep cultural insight will accompany you, making your experience richer and more meaningful.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end="3089" data-start="2919">\r\n\t<p data-end="3089" data-start="2921"><span style="font-size:14px"><strong>Comprehensive sightseeing</strong>: Visit all major highlights without skipping important sites. No rushed or half-day tours &mdash; you get the <strong>complete Bhutan experience</strong>.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end="3217" data-start="3090">\r\n\t<p data-end="3217" data-start="3092"><span style="font-size:14px"><strong>Well-paced itinerary</strong>: Designed for relaxation and enjoyment, with time to rest, explore, and reflect at each location.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end="3340" data-start="3218">\r\n\t<p data-end="3340" data-start="3220"><span style="font-size:14px"><strong>Best value</strong>: Enjoy high service standards, deluxe accommodation, and premium transport at a very reasonable price.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Best Time to Travel</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p data-end="3435" data-start="3379"><span style="font-size:14px">The best seasons for the Deluxe Best of Bhutan Tour are:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end="3793" data-start="3437">\r\n\t<li data-end="3540" data-start="3437">\r\n\t<p data-end="3540" data-start="3439"><span style="font-size:14px"><strong>October to December</strong> &ndash; Crystal clear skies, pleasant temperatures, and beautiful autumn colors.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end="3662" data-start="3541">\r\n\t<p data-end="3662" data-start="3543"><span style="font-size:14px"><strong>March to May</strong> &ndash; The valleys are in full bloom with rhododendrons and wildflowers. Great weather and scenic views.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end="3793" data-start="3663">\r\n\t<p data-end="3793" data-start="3665"><span style="font-size:14px"><strong>September and June</strong> &ndash; These shoulder months offer good weather and fewer crowds, making for a peaceful travel experience.</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style="font-size:16px"><strong>Who Is This Tour Ideal For?</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p data-end="3865" data-start="3840"><span style="font-size:14px">This tour is perfect for:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end="4262" data-start="3867">\r\n\t<li data-end="3941" data-start="3867">\r\n\t<p data-end="3941" data-start="3869"><span style="font-size:14px">First-time travelers who want to see the <strong>best of Bhutan in one visit</strong></span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end="4032" data-start="3942">\r\n\t<p data-end="4032" data-start="3944"><span style="font-size:14px">Cultural enthusiasts who appreciate monasteries, festivals, and traditional architecture</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end="4094" data-start="4033">\r\n\t<p data-end="4094" data-start="4035"><span style="font-size:14px">Spiritual travelers seeking peaceful and sacred experiences</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end="4166" data-start="4095">\r\n\t<p data-end="4166" data-start="4097"><span style="font-size:14px">Couples or small groups looking for <strong>a high-quality guided holiday</strong></span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end="4262" data-start="4167">\r\n\t<p data-end="4262" data-start="4169"><span style="font-size:14px">Photographers and nature lovers who want to capture Bhutan&rsquo;s <strong>natural and spiritual beauty</strong></span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>	The Deluxe Best of Bhutan Tour is one of the most enriching and luxurious ways to experience the hidden Himalayan kingdom of Bhutan. Spanning 10 days , this comprehensive tour is designed for travelers who seek a deep cultural immersion without compromising on comfort and quality . Whether you're a spiritual seeker, a nature lover, a photographer, or simply a curious traveler, this journey will take you through Bhutan's most iconic towns, valleys, monasteries, and dzongs - all while staying in premium 3-star deluxe and 4-star deluxe hotels , traveling in private comfortable transport , and guided by expert local guides . This is not a rushed tour - it's designed for you to fully enjoy and absorb each destination, while still covering all major cultural highlights Bhutan has to offer. Destinations You'll Explore Over 10 unforgettable days, you'll explore the best of Bhutan: Paro - Visit the legendary Tiger's Nest Monastery (Taktsang) , perched dramatically on a cliffside, and explore ancient temples and the National Museum. Thimphu - The capital city that blends tradition and modernity, home to the Buddha Dordenma statue , traditional art schools, the Memorial Chorten, and lively lo	<ul>\r\n\t<li data-end="1000" data-start="923">\r\n\t<p data-end="1000" data-start="925"><span style="font-size:14px">Stay in <strong>deluxe hotels</strong> (minimum 4-star standard) throughout the tour</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end="1082" data-start="1001">\r\n\t<p data-end="1082" data-start="1003"><span style="font-size:14px">Enjoy <strong>comfortable private transportation</strong> for a smooth and relaxing trip</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end="1145" data-start="1083">\r\n\t<p data-end="1145" data-start="1085"><span style="font-size:14px">Guided by <strong>experienced, English-speaking local guides</strong></span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end="1230" data-start="1146">\r\n\t<p data-end="1230" data-start="1148"><span style="font-size:14px">Visit <strong>all major cultural landmarks</strong>, monasteries (Dzongs), and sacred sites</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end="1318" data-start="1231">\r\n\t<p data-end="1318" data-start="1233"><span style="font-size:14px">A <strong>well-paced itinerary</strong> with no rushing &mdash; designed for a fulfilling experience</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end="1401" data-start="1319">\r\n\t<p data-end="1401" data-start="1321"><span style="font-size:14px"><strong>Best value for your money</strong> with excellent service and attention to detail</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>	<p><span style="font-size:14px"><strong>Inclusions at a Glance</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end="4644" data-start="4304">\r\n\t<li data-end="4361" data-start="4304">\r\n\t<p data-end="4361" data-start="4306"><span style="font-size:14px">Deluxe accommodation (3-star deluxe or 4-star hotels)</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end="4408" data-start="4362">\r\n\t<p data-end="4408" data-start="4364"><span style="font-size:14px">Private transportation throughout the tour</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end="4454" data-start="4409">\r\n\t<p data-end="4454" data-start="4411"><span style="font-size:14px">Experienced English-speaking local guides</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end="4454" data-start="4409">\r\n\t<p data-end="4454" data-start="4411"><span style="font-size:14px">&nbsp;All entrance fees to monuments and national sites</span></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end="4549" data-start="4509">\r\n\t<p data-end="4549" data-start="4511"><span style="font-si