COPY public.reviews (id, author, country, title, rating, comment, trip_name, platform, date, status) FROM stdin;
2	Best Annapurna base camp trek	UK	Linda	5	Hello Expert Representative, We arrived UK safely yesterday. we would like to thank you so much for all your outstanding service. The Annapurna base camp trek was excellent. the service of your guide and porter made our trek very nice. everything in Kathmandu, pokhara went well. we hope to see you again.The hotel in Kathmandu and pokhara are excellent. Thanks for everything. Regards, Linda	Linda	Google	2022-07-21	Approved
3	Luxury Everest base camp trek	Australia	Amanda	5	We found Expert Representative's company very professional in quick response. All the service from beginning to end was fabulous. We had a great trek in Nepal. Our guide was Lhakpa Sherpa and a very nice guide throughout the trip to Everest base camp. We enjoyed the all-luxury hotels and lodges. A very well-organized trek. we are going to use Nepal trekking company again for another trip soon. Amanda,	Amanda	TripAdvisor	2022-07-22	Approved
4	Everest base camp by Helicopter	USA	Robert	5	Hello Expert Representative, Thanks for your email after our return home. We reached home and would like to thank you a lot for all the best service you have provided during our Nepal trip. We had a awesome vacation in Nepal. Every little service was handled well. Your guide, Rinji, is perfect and the porter is very helpful. The lodges you have booked are very nice. The helicopter ride back after the trek was enjoyable and it was nice to return to Lukla by helicopter rather than walk back the same route. Thanks for all your great service. It was a great trip. Sincerely, Robert	Robert	Google	2022-07-22	Approved
5	Luxury Annapurna Base Camp Trek	USA	Gary	5	Wonderful trekking service, very nice sherpa staff, all the lodges are nice. Hotels in Kathmandu and Pokhara are the best. Over all, we have no complaints about the services you have provided. Thanks for your outstanding service. We appreciate your quickest communications and perfect arrangements for this type of luxury hiking in Annapuna, we would like to do the Everest trek in the next two years. Best regards, Gary	Gary	TripAdvisor	2022-07-24	Approved
7	Luxury Annapurna Circuit Trek	Australia	David	5	Hello, There are many annapurna circuit trek packages by different companies on the internet. After very careful research, we selected Luxury annapurna circuit trek advertised by Expert Representative's company. from the beginning of the trek planning to booking, he is so professional for quick response and everything has been arranged so well. we had nice hot showers in most of nights in trek except few nights during throngla pass. the local jeep drive was nice in the begining and after throng la pass as we got bit tired from the trek. rest day hotspring( tatopani) is perfect for relax after long circuit. poonhill is fabulous place to see full mountain ranges. about lodges, it is all nice and most important for this great trek is because of our so friendly and helpful guide and porter. we highly reccomend this trek and Expert Representative's company to everyone and we will do another trek again. Best wishes, David	David	TripAdvisor	2022-07-24	Approved
8	Luxury Nepal Tour	south Africa	Dave richard	5	Hello Expert Representative, We just want to write this email to let you know we fully enjoyed the luxury tour in Nepal. Everything has been provided by your staff as per your itinerary. The tour guides are very knowledgeable. The best hotels are Dwarika in Kathmandu and Dhulikhel and Chitwan National Park. All the other hotels are the best too. You have a very well set-up itinerary and it is best for people who want to do a luxury tour. We are also lucky for nice weather to see mountains. Thanks for all the arrangements, I will recommend this tour and your company to my friends. Sincerely yours, Dave	Dave richard	Google	2022-07-24	Approved
9	Luxury Everest Experience Trek	South Africa	Patricia	5	I would like to recommend this short trek to everyone if you are looking for a short hike to see Mount Everest. We had a great trek with NTT company. Their itinerary and service offer is the best one. The lodges and Yeti mountain homes are fabulous. The hotel, Darika, is the best one. This is a perfect one-week trek for us. Our guide and porter were very helpful in making sure we had everything in order to enjoy the trek. All the services are so professional. We are going back to Nepal one day again and will use this company again. Kind regards, Patricia	Patricia	TripAdvisor	2022-07-24	Approved
10	Luxury Annapurna Experience Trek	Dubai	Richard morgan	5	Hi Expert Representative, Thanks for your email about our Nepal trip experience. Our family trip to Annapurna experience you have recommended is very nice. My two children, myself and my husband all had a wonderful holiday in Nepal. We enjoyed the trip to Kathmandu, Pokhara and the short trek around Annapurna. The Luxury lodges you have booked for us are very clean with hot water. Our guide made all the meals and necessary rooms requirements well in the trek. The hotel in Pokhara is very beautiful and Kathmandu is the best. Thank you very much for all your assistance. Hope to see you again and I will recommend your company to my friends. Sincerely yours, Richard Morgan	Richard morgan	Google	2022-07-24	Approved
1	Best trekking tour service- Excellent Local Travel Agency in Nepal	USA	Adam Smith	5	My wife and I did Everest base camp trek with Expert Representative's company in march 2015. The service from Airport pick up to final drop off was excellent. city tour guide is excellent in information about heritage sites. our trekking guide Expert Representative is outstanding. our porter Ngima tendi is so kind made our trek so special. all the lodges selected were very nice with choices of meals. overall we had a great time and we would like to reccommend Expert Representative's company to all. we are coming back again for another trip with CCC Nepal trekking tours company. Adam	Adam Smith	TripAdvisor	2021-10-07	Approved
6	Luxury Helicopter Annapurna Base Camp Trek	Brazil	mike	5	My wife and I are looking for a little luxury trek in Nepal and during a search on the internet, we found CCC Nepal trekking tours company is offering luxury annapurna base camp trek with a helicopter in Pokhara. We booked this trek with Expert Representative. He is super fast at communication and provides full information anytime. His guide Lhakpa and porter Ganesh are very professional staff. They pick all the nicest lodges along the trail to make our accommodation as comfortable as possible. They recommend the best foods all the time. They walk with us all the time and are always helpful for small things like the best photos, rest locations and lunch places. Besides that, hotels in the cities are really luxurious and private cars and flights are included to make the trip the best experience. We are coming back again with them for another trek in Nepal. Best regards, Mike and Amanda	mike	Google	2022-07-24	Approved
\.


